{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "\u30b7\u30ce\u30d3\u30b6\u30e0\u30e9\u30a4\uff0fShinobi Samurai",
    "steam_appid": 3837990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/473aae320e1d5a40ba3fad87efecbf93.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/195f02037653bf1bd2584ade0de59c48.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kino Konoe, a pawnbroker's daughter, catches a cold and tries to take medicine, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medicine she takes is a &quot;time capsule&quot; that was sold at pawnbrokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks it, she will travel back in time to the present day...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/047e21c111778d878c741fd2b7fd9ec6.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she meets a wonderful man named Kazama, but it ends up being a dream at the best part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks the &quot;time capsule&quot; again, she should be able to meet him again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then two ninjas who are after it and a samurai who helps her appear...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/cc52b1bdb030a67c523557eb5adb80a7.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of friendship and love between a ninja and a samurai!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Shinobi Samurai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target: All ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language: Japanese, English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of players: 1 (no internet)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings: 3 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stills and pictures: 15</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/473aae320e1d5a40ba3fad87efecbf93.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/195f02037653bf1bd2584ade0de59c48.avif?t=1752497247\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kino Konoe, a pawnbroker's daughter, catches a cold and tries to take medicine, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The medicine she takes is a &quot;time capsule&quot; that was sold at pawnbrokers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks it, she will travel back in time to the present day...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/047e21c111778d878c741fd2b7fd9ec6.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There she meets a wonderful man named Kazama, but it ends up being a dream at the best part of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If she drinks the &quot;time capsule&quot; again, she should be able to meet him again...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But then two ninjas who are after it and a samurai who helps her appear...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3837990/extras/cc52b1bdb030a67c523557eb5adb80a7.avif?t=1752497247\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story of friendship and love between a ninja and a samurai!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Title: Shinobi Samurai</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Target: All ages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Language: Japanese, English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Number of players: 1 (no internet)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings: 3 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stills and pictures: 15</p>",
    "short_description": "The item passed around the pawn shop turns out to be a Time Capsule, a drug that will send you to the present day...! This is a story about the youth of the shinobi and kunoichi who are after it, and the samurai who help them! It's a slightly unusual visual novel adventure!",
